<title>USA: Amerijet adds Boeing 727-200 freighter to fleet.</title>
<headline>Amerijet adds Boeing 727-200 freighter to fleet.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Amerijet International Inc., the Fort Launderdale all-cargo carrier said it has added a Boeing 727-200 jet to its all-cargo aircraft fleet.</p>
<p>The new B727-200, which brings the company fleet to 11 Boeing 727-200 and 727-100s, went into service on March 20. -- Reuters Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax:5017</p>
</text>
